@startuml
title DFD Level-0 (Simple)\nAI-Based Customer Support Automation System
left to right direction

' External entities
actor Client as C
actor "Support Agent" as SA
actor Administrator as A
actor "External AI Service" as AISvc

' Main system process
rectangle "AI-Based Customer Support\nAutomation System" as System

' Internal data stores
database "User Data" as D_User
database "Ticket & Message Data" as D_Ticket
database "Knowledge Base" as D_KB
database "Analytics Data" as D_Analytics

' ---- Client data flows ----
C --> System : Login / Register\nCredentials
System --> C : Auth result

C --> System : Chat messages,\nSupport enquiries
System --> C : Chatbot replies,\nTicket status updates

' ---- Support Agent data flows ----
SA --> System : Login
System --> SA : Auth result

SA --> System : Ticket updates,\nResolution notes
System --> SA : Escalated tickets,\nTicket details

' ---- Administrator data flows ----
A --> System : Login
System --> A : Auth result

A --> System : Manage users,\nManage knowledge base
System --> A : Management feedback

A --> System : Request analytics
System --> A : Dashboard data,\nReports

' ---- External AI Service data flows ----
System --> AISvc : Text for NLP,\nSentiment, response suggestions
AISvc --> System : Intent,\nSentiment score,\nAI response,\nConfidence score

' ---- System to data stores ----
System --> D_User : Store/Retrieve\nuser accounts & roles
System --> D_Ticket : Store/Retrieve\ntickets & messages
System --> D_KB : Store/Retrieve\nFAQ entries & templates
System --> D_Analytics : Store/Retrieve\naggregated metrics

@enduml
 State Diagram
@startuml
title State Machine Diagram - Ticket Lifecycle
left to right direction

[*] --> New

New --> Classified : AI classifies ticket
Classified --> Prioritised : Priority assigned
Prioritised --> Analyzed : Sentiment / confidence checked

Analyzed --> ResolvedByAI : AI solves issue
Analyzed --> Escalated : Low confidence / negative sentiment / complex issue

ResolvedByAI --> Closed : Client informed
Escalated --> AssignedToAgent : Ticket sent to support agent
AssignedToAgent --> InProgress : Agent opens ticket
InProgress --> WaitingForCustomer : Agent requests more info
WaitingForCustomer --> InProgress : Customer replies
InProgress --> Resolved : Agent resolves issue
Resolved --> Closed : Client informed

Closed --> [*]

@enduml
 